---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party fonts

The typefaces under engine/Fonts are NOT covered by the licence above. Each one
carries its own licence text and copyright notice in its own folder, and those
must travel with it.

  SIL Open Font License 1.1        (see OFL.txt in each folder)
    Elms Sans          Copyright 2025, The Elms Sans Project Authors
    Glametrix          Copyright (c) 2012-2013, gluk (www.glukfonts.pl)
                       Reserved Font Name: Glametrix
                       licence text at misc/OFL_License-61e0.txt
    Mulish             Copyright 2016, The Mulish Project Authors
    Noto Sans Display  Copyright 2015, Google Inc.
                       Noto is a trademark of Google Inc.

All of these permit redistribution, and all permit embedding a font in a document,
which is what this engine does when it subsets a face into a PDF. None permits
selling the fonts on their own.

The test suite copies Mulish into tests/output/fonts-clash, to prove that two files
claiming one name are reported rather than one hiding the other. It copies Mulish's
OFL.txt beside it, so that copy travels with its licence like the original.

A font that cannot produce its own licence text does not go in here. A label on a
download page is not a licence: one font already said "freeware" there while its
own licence file forbade redistribution in as many words.
